zO8sv0spBcEQ7kNvwEZlFpU&_nc_oc=Adrajdt85XJK1vaHsvxXp_V1GzIDhbUl5FX0KKnPNFr03cqOgiNFbnNU_ZXPMb9VNvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2G99YVHS_xD1vdy8TknpA3Jz3q-NqZ6SMXtHRm1yXtGA&oe=69EB7AB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PC_9xqqsqHcQ7kNvwFVkBTP&_nc_oc=AdoW0KwmYDEPndY_31mpPTzgGpwo9ali_DU8aXDSk_Lfizrfqa1RDA90GzYjcTh8PSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1ltgtmWZxA8twV8sm8FUJgjv93Q0xFJla0MyS9Un9rMg&oe=69EB7C4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hqAxEhchQ2kQ7kNvwF5AyYw&_nc_oc=Adpdc4R_83OfNkbeWF_TlhHfg8KQw5FNWaFYCGvRqhslKllid37_eKeqcSWWHNFIqo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3QSed6cWNbMRU1OIXVXBX3hgp5NaS5SI6nrW72eFbzGQ&oe=69EB696F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SV3u49PI0SIQ7kNvwH1iS52&_nc_oc=AdrRZ5slyQqxeDpglGu159iv9YYzakTZpE1yR3gJlGvraoZv241YyC5tOnUZCXmydNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0exwG_XIUgM80Z58G9ic4MxBprtn_bs4z-xf-agNdeKw&oe=69EB8B03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SIqGdBCRmc8Q7kNvwFOhYJZ&_nc_oc=AdpK_VdJBJNi4oQr-UqFtl3wVPFyZZPbmbrldqMRe6mtm7mXGnN1JbIA6VtACxpyEUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3BpcPf31e8gLQIxKDKqUxFt68BJoRqDAzltjVJ_227BQ&oe=69EB8358"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DmT1g5NwhVoQ7kNvwGZhaR0&_nc_oc=AdqiodVfutnEwfTXgTFu40d8Ifi-3D2ufk4peFKb0tudhPGlOfXmEf7HKRWPxhmcUhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3BzTgiQO3H28vLbtlZY7dzEnMForw8P4VRNPhJaPifQw&oe=69EB5E3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080